+<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><math id="m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-bench: A Benchmark for <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">T</span>ool-<span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">A</span>gent-<span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">U</span>ser Interaction in Real-World Domains</h1>
+<div class="ltx_authors">
