+<span class="ltx_personname">Shunyu Yao
+</span><span id="id4" class="ltx_note ltx_note_frontmatter ltx_thanks_note ltx_role_thanks"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">†</sup><span class="ltx_note_type">thanks: </span>Work done during internship. Code and data: <a href="https://github.com/sierra-research/tau-bench" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/sierra-research/tau-bench</a>.</span></span></span></span>
+<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
+<span class="ltx_personname">Noah Shinn
+</span></span>
