+<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Figure <a href="#A1.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Appendix A Additional Results ‣ 𝜏-bench: A Benchmark for Tool-Agent-User Interaction in Real-World Domains" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>τ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau</annotation></semantics></math>-bench tasks have a well-balanced and diverse spectrum of difficulties. We use such a plot to find tasks with zero success, and examine the task annotations in a targeted way.</p>
